<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav August inflation 2.3 pct m/m vs 6.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav August inflation 2.3 pct m/m vs 6.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV INFLATION	   AUG	  JULY	 AUG 1995</p>
<p> monthly RPI index rise    + 2.3	+ 6.6	 + 8.0</p>
<p> yr/yr pct change	    +99.2	108.7	   N.A.</p>
<p>NOTES -- Figures refer to rump Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro. -- Gordana Kukic, Belgrade Newsroom, 381 11 222 4254</p>
